flowchart TD
    subgraph UI["Interfaces"]
        WEB["Streamlit UI (app.py)<br/>manual controls + chat box"]
        CLI["Terminal demo (main.py)"]
    end

    OWNERSTATE["Owner / Pet / Task state<br/>(pawpal_system.py dataclasses)"]

    subgraph AGENT["Agentic Care Advisor (agent.py)"]
        VALIDATE["1. Input guardrails<br/>empty / oversized message check"]
        SAFETY["2. Safety guardrail<br/>medical keyword redirect"]
        PLAN["3. Plan<br/>live Claude tool-use OR<br/>offline keyword planner (fallback)"]
        ACT["4. Act<br/>execute_tool() calls"]
        VERIFY["5. Verify<br/>rebuild schedule, check budget,<br/>surface conflicts"]
    end

    TOOLS["Tool functions<br/>get_schedule · add_task · remove_task ·<br/>adjust_priority · set_time_budget"]

    SCHEDULER["Scheduler (pawpal_system.py)<br/>sort_tasks · filter_tasks · build_plan ·<br/>detect_conflicts"]

    CLAUDE["Claude API (Anthropic)<br/>live mode only, needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY"]

    HUMAN["Pet owner (human-in-the-loop)<br/>reads plan + conflict warnings +<br/>reasoning trace, approves or overrides"]

    EVAL["Reliability layer<br/>tests/test_agent.py (pytest) +<br/>evaluation.py (scored harness)"]

    WEB -->|natural-language request| VALIDATE
    CLI -->|natural-language request| VALIDATE
    VALIDATE --> SAFETY
    SAFETY -->|blocked: medical topic| HUMAN
    SAFETY -->|OK| PLAN
    PLAN <-.->|tool-use turns, if API key set| CLAUDE
    PLAN --> ACT
    ACT --> TOOLS
    TOOLS --> OWNERSTATE
    TOOLS --> SCHEDULER
    SCHEDULER --> OWNERSTATE
    ACT --> VERIFY
    VERIFY --> SCHEDULER
    VERIFY -->|reply + full trace| WEB
    VERIFY -->|reply + full trace| CLI
    WEB --> HUMAN
    CLI --> HUMAN

    EVAL -.->|exercises| AGENT
    EVAL -.->|exercises| SCHEDULER

    style AGENT fill:#f3e5f5
    style TOOLS fill:#fff3e0
    style SCHEDULER fill:#e8f5e9
    style CLAUDE fill:#fce4ec
    style HUMAN fill:#e1f5ff
    style EVAL fill:#f1f8e9
